# The module and its sample manifest are fetched, never vendored — a
# checked-in copy is a module that can lag the toolchain it exposes and
# a sample set that can drift from the corpus (gero-lab.md §9, §10).
public/gero.wasm
public/samples.json
public/tree-sitter-*

# CI's checkout of the gero repository, for building the module.
.gero/
